<section class="w3l-stats-section py-5" id="stats"> <style> .stats-inner-layout { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; }

    .stats-img-left {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        flex: 0 0 45%;
    }

    .stats-img-left img {
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        width: 100%;
        height: 480px;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    .video-play-button {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #00bcd4;
        font-size: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        transition: 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
        z-index: 3;
    }

    .video-play-button:hover {
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1);
        color: #008fa3;
        background: #f8f8f8;
    }

    .stats-right-content {
        background-color: #00bcd4;
        color: white;
        padding: 60px 40px 110px 100px; 
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-left: -60px; 
        z-index: 1;
        flex: 0 0 65%;
    }

    .stats-grid-container {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 25px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        margin-top: 25px;
        padding-top: 25px;
    }

    .stat-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 15px;
    }

    .stat-item i {
        font-size: 32px;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .stat-info h4 {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .stat-info p {
        font-size: 13px;
        margin: 0;
        opacity: 0.8;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .contact-card-white {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 20px 35px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -25px;
        right: 10%;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        z-index: 4;
    }

    .contact-card-white i {
        font-size: 40px;
        color: #00bcd4;
    }

    .contact-card-white .call-text p {
        color: #d86a25;
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    .contact-card-white .call-text h4 {
        color: #d86a25;
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 20px;
    }
</style>

<div class="container py-lg-5">
    <div class="stats-inner-layout row g-0">
        <div class="col-lg-5 stats-img-left">
            <img src="~/Traversal-Liberty/assets/images/g8.jpg" alt="VHB City İstanbul" />
            <a href="[http://youtube.com/watch?v=o9esB3n-GAw](http://youtube.com/watch?v=o9esB3n-GAw)" target="_blank" class="video-play-button">
                <span class="fa fa-play"></span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-7 stats-right-content">
            <h6 class="mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d86a25;">Daha Fazlası İçin Arayın</h6>
            <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4" style="font-size: 32px; color: #d86a25;">VHB CITY İLE ŞEHRİ KEŞFEDİN, BİZİMLE SEYAHAT EDİN!</h2>
            
            <p class="mb-3">VHB City, Türkiye'nin en güvenilir ve köklü seyahat acentelerinden biridir. Profesyonel ekibimizle turizm sektöründe; Seyahat Acentesi, Destinasyon Yönetimi (DMC) ve Organizasyon Planlama alanlarında hizmet vermekteyiz.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Türkiye genelinde 110 farklı destinasyonda; kültür turları, doğa gezileri ve unutulmaz anılar biriktireceğiniz özel programlarla hizmetinizdeyiz. Misafirimiz olun ve farkı hissedin!</p>

            <div class="stats-grid-container">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-users"></i>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <h4>500+</h4>
                        <p>Mutlu Misafir</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item" style="border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding-left: 20px;">
                    <i class="fa fa-trophy"></i>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <h4>250+</h4>
                        <p>Başarılı Tur</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <i class="fa fa-user-plus"></i>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <h4>15+</h4>
                        <p>Yıllık Üyelik</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item" style="border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding-left: 20px;">
                    <i class="fa fa-map"></i>
                    <div class="stat-info">
                        <h4>10+</h4>
                        <p>Rota Seçeneği</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-card-white">
            <i class="fa fa-phone-square"></i>
            <div class="call-text">
                <p>7/24 Acil Destek Hattımız</p>
                <h4>Bize Ulaşın: +90 123 456 78 90</h4>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</section>